# Many reads of the same chip ID (past debounce window)
name: many-reads-same-chip
version: 1
description: Many reads of the same chip, each past the debounce window, all recorded.

boot
rtc SYNCED 1700000000000
repeat 100
  advance_ms 3000
  read CHIP-001
end
assert observations 100
assert next_sequence 101
assert sequences_unique
assert sequences_monotonic